---
import Store from '../layouts/Store.astro';
import ProductArt from '../components/ProductArt.astro';
import products from '../data/products.json';
---
<Store><section class="hero wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">FROM A PLACE. FOR EVERY DAY.</p><h1>Carry a little<br/><em>Odisha.</em></h1><p class="lead">A sailing story on a cup.<br/>A familiar name on your shoulder.<br/>A small piece of home, wherever you are.</p><a class="button" href="#collection">Explore the collection ↗</a><p class="small">T-SHIRT · JHULA · STORY CUP · WATER BOTTLE</p></div><figure class="range-board"><img src="/images/project-odisha-range-concept.png" alt="Project Odisha collection concept: black T-shirt, long Jhula, story cup and black and blue bottles" width="1536" height="1024"/><figcaption>Our new Project Odisha identity. Design concepts; physical samples are still to be reviewed.</figcaption></figure></section>
<div class="ribbon">SEA BLUE. LATERITE EARTH. EVERYDAY BELONGING.</div>
<section class="wrap collection" id="collection"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE FIRST COLLECTION</p><h2>Find something<br/><em>you’d like to keep.</em></h2></div><p>Four everyday objects, with colours and shapes<br/>you can help us choose.</p></div><p class="notice">Choose a design and send a pre-order interest request. You pay nothing now. We’ll contact you when the product is ready, with its final details and price. Your request does not reserve stock or commit you to buy.</p><div class="products">{products.filter(p=>p.kind!=='poetry-jhula').map(p=><article><a href={'/product/'+p.id+'/'} class="product-link"><ProductArt product={p}/><div class="product-title"><h3>{p.name}</h3><span>↗</span></div></a><p>{p.variant_options.length} {p.kind==='tee'?'proposed sizes':'design options'} · Design concept</p><p class="price" data-price={p.id}>Price to be confirmed</p></article>)}</div><a class="text-link" href="/catalog/">See all options, prices and supply →</a></section>
<section class="wrap poetry-intro"><p class="eyebrow">ODIA POETRY JHULA · KABI JHULAS</p><h2>A book for the road.<br/><em>A little of home.</em></h2><p class="lead">Twenty cloth-bag designs for readers and writers, with eighteen matching Poetry Kit studies. Choose the Jhula on its own or the kit where one is shown.</p><a class="button" href="/kabi-jhulas/">Explore the Kabi Jhulas →</a></section><section class="story"><div class="wrap story-grid"><p class="eyebrow">A SHARED STORY</p><div><h2>A riverbank.<br/><em>A boat setting out.</em></h2><p>Our first collection draws on Odisha’s maritime memory: the boats we float, the journeys we imagine and the connections we carry. The illustrated voyage is an artistic interpretation, not a reconstruction of a particular ship or journey.</p><p>The current collection will carry the Project Odisha name. Some individual design studies still show the earlier UTKAL wordmark; we keep them visible so you can see the shape and artwork clearly.</p><a class="text-link" href="/design-review/">Explore the earlier design studies →</a></div></div></section>
<section class="wrap closing"><p class="eyebrow">AN ODISHA COLLECTIVE PROJECT</p><h2>Make it worth keeping.</h2><p>We’re developing the designs before committing to production. Materials, size charts, samples and delivery timing are still to be confirmed. Odisha Store’s commercial work remains separate from Project Odisha’s editorial decisions.</p></section></Store>
<script>import '../scripts/catalog.js';</script>
